Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:34.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永遠在一起！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:39.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 大谷明天就要考試了 我怎麼也靜不下來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發個加油的簡訊好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有郵件
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(大谷:救救我)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.78,0:01:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這附近的人我都找遍了 沒一個能幫得上忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:56.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請進
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:01:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:01:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 幹嘛這麼客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是客不客氣的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:02.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道啦知道啦 快進來快進來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:08.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道是你的男朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:09.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這位是大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.47,0:02:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 我能問你個問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身高以外的問題都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.51,0:02:15.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不介意嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真囉嗦 一邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:19.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 有客人來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.92,0:02:21.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 這就是我剛剛說的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊呀啊呀啊呀 孩子他爸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:29.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 不用連老爸也叫來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:32.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 原來在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:33.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嚇了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:40.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,初次見面 我 我是小泉 不 理莎的男朋友 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.85,0:02:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦爸爸 我今天什麼都沒準備
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.09,0:02:43.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請別客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:46.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身高…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.11,0:02:49.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,156公分 不好意思 矮了點 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你覺得這個大高個合適嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼大高個
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:55.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 今天冒昧來訪 真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:02:58.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請讓我留住一宿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:02:59.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 讓我來解釋一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是那樣的 我沒有別的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.15,0:03:09.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實大谷明天要考試 但他全家都染上了流行性感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:10.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是如此 所以 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:12.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的沒有別的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:16.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他睡在哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:20.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的房間 哦不 我睡別的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:21.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:23.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:27.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 累壞了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:30.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有 嗯 一點而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:34.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是很奇怪 我在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:37.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏在考試前發生這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:38.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:46.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 等考完了一定再重新登門拜訪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:53.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣子 他們肯定會認為我是不顧考試只會跟女朋友廝混的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:55.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已經解釋過了 沒事的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我討厭這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:03:59.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不用這麼較勁嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:02.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什麼時候都很認真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最討厭半途而廢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛這樣啊 與其介意這件事 還是多想想明天的考試吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:09.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說的有理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好複習吧 我去弟弟的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:16.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸 這樣好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:19.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一起肯定會聊得沒完沒了的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.35,0:04:20.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想打擾你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:21.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:24.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼需要隨時叫我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 那你加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:32.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 開工了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是呀 大谷沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:40.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算在考試前一天被趕出家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:42.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還莫名其妙地拜訪了我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:45.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也沒什麼好擔心的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打擾了 要來點宵夜嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦 要叫醒他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:03.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是讓他多睡會兒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:15.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睫毛真長啊 好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:24.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天要加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:40.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（oh no）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:43.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷快起來 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:46.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幾點考試啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:49.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,9點 20分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:51.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經8點多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:56.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到考場要多長時間
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乘電車大約一個小時
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.18,0:05:59.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許還趕得上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:01.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,東西別忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼不叫醒我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.27,0:06:04.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼但是 什麼都別說了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:16.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:20.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雪 怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:24.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,電車和公車都停運了 剛剛電視上說的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦啊 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:29.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:31.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.86,0:06:36.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自從我昨天被趕出家門的那一刻 我的人生就脫軌了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:38.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為這場雪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:43.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嚇了我一跳 下得這麼大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道會積多高
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:07:01.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這場雪是下在每個考生頭上的 又不是你一個人受災
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在說什麼喪氣話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起來 站起來大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:06.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正站著
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是個敢說敢做的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有說喪氣話的工夫還不如抓緊趕過去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:13.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:13.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給你們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:14.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:21.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是電車已經停了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.45,0:07:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就去搭地鐵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是別勉強了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你別亂來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上西天的話只能說抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.08,0:07:31.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放我下來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:36.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷你這麼努力地學習 我不希望你的努力白費
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.99,0:07:40.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管考上考不上 盡力就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要讓你之前的努力白費
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自行車禁止載人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:49.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地鐵到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.62,0:07:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天考試結束時 我要微笑著對你說：辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:00.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（理莎：還有5分鐘）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:03.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（大谷：我連小時候的記憶 都全部消失了）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:06.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（理莎：走好）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.45,0:08:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（大谷：好）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:10.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.98,0:08:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Fight
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.61,0:08:17.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫那麼響幹嘛 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:20.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你絕對沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:23.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 考試正式開始
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.09,0:08:31.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未來志願啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:32.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:35.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又見面了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:40.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考試結果要在一週後出來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:43.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總之我們從漫長的備考中解放出來囉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久沒出來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們去哪裡 看點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隨便隨便 去哪都好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天是小泉的感恩日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:56.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我備考的時候你哪裡都沒去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以今天你說怎樣就怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 敦敦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大嬸你怎麼也在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:14.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:17.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹什麼啊 打扮成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.19,0:09:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:19.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雜誌攝影
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為美美是個超級模特兒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:25.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 對哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天是戶外攝影
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸 第一次看到別人攝影呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.99,0:09:33.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幫我拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:39.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你沒問題吧 會感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:40.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不會的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為我是專業級的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:50.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 要拍囉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 那邊的那個 好噁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真厲害 真厲害 美美大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:11.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太感動了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,專業 你是專業的 超級專業
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.91,0:10:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是說了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美 是你的朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:22.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大嬸靠邊站 這位是我的男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:27.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:30.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 本來預定兩個人拍的那場 就請你的朋友幫個忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天要來的那個人臨時來不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你來試試看吧 好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:37.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 模特兒 我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這傢伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼可能嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:45.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒問題的 你個子這麼高 時尚感也不錯 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行不行不行不行不行 不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:51.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎麼能當模特兒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請做成咖哩的顏色
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:01.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會讓你更加可愛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:04.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可愛 絕對不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:06.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒問題 交給我好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:09.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總覺得那個人好有型哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:24.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:29.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對不行 凍死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:31.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好棒哦 跟我預想的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:33.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要說了 好丟人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好可愛 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:36.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎 真的可愛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:41.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠了 你轉過去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好過分
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:47.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來 做準備了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:12:00.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…旁邊的女孩 能多笑一點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:02.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.18,0:12:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我果然做不了模特兒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然做不了 不過這樣看著感覺挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.35,0:12:21.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很可愛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別搞措了 這都是造型師的功勞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美好喜歡中原小姐給我挑的衣服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:32.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,造型師？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴真甜呀 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.39,0:12:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的啦 跟中原小姐一起工作感覺真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.31,0:12:40.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又來了又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:48.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:53.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到想做的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.99,0:12:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你不會是想做模特兒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.51,0:12:59.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能 你在鏡頭前超僵硬的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然確實蠻可愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:05.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 一點點啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:08.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝 不過你放心啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想做的是造型師
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:14.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,造型師啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.48,0:13:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能不行吧 但我挺喜歡給模特兒挑衣服的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:23.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白痴 不是行不行的問題 而是你想不想做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.01,0:13:24.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:27.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就拿出自信去吧 你不是很有毅力的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:28.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 大谷老師向你保證
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:34.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷老師
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難受 放手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:38.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷老師還真溫柔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過在那之前 問題是他成不成得了老師
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.89,0:13:46.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:47.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遙 MAITY老師
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.29,0:13:51.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,順便兜風就兜到這了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.85,0:13:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:54.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:57.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是理莎的愛人 這位是我的外遇情人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:13:59.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小堀 別被他們給耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:02.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛剛都是騙我的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:08.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷有跟你聯絡了嗎 今天是放榜日了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:09.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒 還沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:11.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 剛剛看到那個小矮人了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:13.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,車站前的長椅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這樣子坐著 叫他小矮人也不甩我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:21.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙肯定落榜了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:24.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那樣就太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 工作怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:31.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,廚房的小個子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:34.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,初次見面 我是理莎的媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:35.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:36.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好年輕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:37.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 大谷有跟你聯絡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:41.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（又耍我啊）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:42.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒 怎麼這麼問
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打了很多電話都沒接
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:45.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,百分之百落榜了 果然是個白痴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.75,0:14:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸災樂禍會遭天譴的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:53.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是保薦合格生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:54.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您所撥打的電話暫時無法接通 請在提示音後留言
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,結束留言請按#號
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:14.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定落榜了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:21.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又怎麼了 不是說過不要發出怪聲的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:23.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 我請求早退
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:26.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,緊急事件 拜託您了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.60,0:15:27.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:31.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,松原小姐 我會把小泉的那份做完的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:32.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小堀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:40.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很對不起 這個月不發薪水也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 我也有過這種歲月呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:48.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不會被耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:56.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事的大谷 今年不行的話 還有明年呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:16:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算再學一年還不行 我一輩子都會支持你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:03.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:21.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 你在哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:23.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃避的是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行大谷 你不能死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了有什麼好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.74,0:16:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰說要死了 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:48.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:50.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明年再考一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:54.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明明考上了 幹嘛還要再考一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都說了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼說 我都說我考上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:02.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人 怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你不是坐在車站前的長椅上垂頭喪氣的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:09.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那時放下心來我就睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,電話也不接
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手機在充電 本想醒來後就想去小泉那的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:25.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼嘛 原來考上了啊 考上了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:27.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼怎麼了 白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:33.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一下子睡覺 手機又充電 讓人家多擔心知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:35.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也沒辦法 你打工的時候又不能打電話進去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:36.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,話雖如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼嘛 好不容易考上了 卻聽到‘騙人 怎麼會’之類的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:43.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也說點別的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:47.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我太擔心了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:52.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉 怎麼樣也不用在這裡哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:17:59.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是人家高興嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.01,0:18:08.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有小泉你 我是絕對不可能那麼努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我能考上都是小泉你的功勞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:14.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我剛剛在這裡就這麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:15.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個讓人操心的傢伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:25.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:27.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家各自決定了人生的前進道路 馬上就要分開了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:50.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能 最後 到最後了居然還遲到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你連畢業典禮都遲到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:18:57.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:18:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也對哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹什麼啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:03.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這句話我原封不動還給你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.21,0:19:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再還你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准還
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠了嗎 笨蛋二人組
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:09.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看來真的要在畢業證書上寫上你們ALL阪神巨人的大名
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:16.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別學我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:18.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們忘了自己遲到的事情了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧 注意腳下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:27.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:30.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貧血 但她是學生代表呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那還真糟糕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.56,0:19:39.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以上 是在校生代表的發言
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:39.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 那對白痴又遲到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:42.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下來 有請畢業生代表講話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:42.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,畢業典禮都快結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.17,0:19:44.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,畢業生代表
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:51.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,畢業生代表大谷敦士 小泉理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 好長 這些全部都要讀嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:01.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白痴 你在對著話筒說話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.82,0:20:02.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙你幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那大谷拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一人一半
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我先讀了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:08.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在讀什麼啊 給我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:11.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:13.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你給我住手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:16.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什麼 這樣怎麼讀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:17.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:22.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安靜 安靜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.01,0:20:29.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師們 這三年來真的麻煩你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:32.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,託你們的福 大家都長大了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:33.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉本來就很大隻
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:37.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說的也是啊 也有原來就這麼小的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:37.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙 我要揍人了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:44.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 在舞戶學園裡充滿著我們快樂的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:48.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有很多美妙的相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 這些 在今天都要分開了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有要去遠方的人 也有即將分離的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想到這裡 我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.40,0:21:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙 哭什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.70,0:21:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.37,0:21:22.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 最後讓我們高呼萬歲三次來結束吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:23.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有搞笑二人組怎麼行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.93,0:21:27.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,準備
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萬歲 萬歲 萬歲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:48.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和大谷相遇 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜歡你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 有小泉在身邊太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:22:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今後 也要永遠在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.88,0:23:24.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,ByeBye 再見了~
